ORIGINAL Minimal Reproducible Example authored for tree-sitter-cmd.

File:           mre-interactive-menu.bat
Provenance:     Original work, part of this repository (no third party).
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Copyright (c) tree-sitter-cmd contributors

Distills the interactive-launcher idioms of menu/sandbox scripts such as the
WiX Toolset sandbox launchers (MS-RL, reciprocal — not vendorable verbatim).
No third-party text is reproduced. Independent zero-ERROR parse-regression for:
  - the quoted `set /p "name=prompt"` form (prompt carrying trailing spaces)
  - delayed-expansion menu state with `if /i "!answer!"=="q"` dispatch
  - blocks combining `&` with `goto`, and FOR /F usebackq over a command
